## Diagnostic comparison

Compare a fresh V4, a hidden repeated V4, and the preserved V3 at matched delivered application mass, substrate, rest time and temperature. This tests the complete revision, with the carrier confound explicitly retained.

For the more specific Orris omission, use a shared identical non-Orris mixture. Weigh the selected Orris stock dose s. The omission arm receives 0.91s DEP and 0.09s common dilution solvent, preserving stock-derived DEP and total replaced mass. The selected arm receives s of the 9% stock. This is a carrier-matched active-omission design; the solvent occupying omitted product mass is declared. All arms require a separate explicit weigh-out record and equal final mass; do not infer the control from 91% of the stock's µL.

Evaluate root richness, root recognition, smoothness, powder flatness, fruit takeover, and reference similarity separately at opening, 5 min, 30 min, 2 h, 4 h, and optionally next-day blotter. V4 succeeds only if preferred root character survives within the full frame. Skin life, sillage radius and liking remain NOT TESTED.

